# Build context exclusions for the marketing image.
#
# This file did not exist before 2026-09-29, although README.md claimed it did.

# The 5-minute demo mp4 is a local build output: the Dockerfile's builder stage
# regenerates it from DEMO_SCRIPT.md, so an on-disk copy is overwritten anyway.
# Excluding it keeps 6.7 MB of stale media — the only render ever produced, and
# one that carried retracted narration — out of the build context entirely.
assets/*.mp4

# Repository and tooling scratch that must never enter an image.
.git/
_build/
dist/

# Python bytecode and editor scratch.
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
